        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86700, Modern Allerton Knob</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern Allerton Knob is the perfect accent for any kitchen cabinet. Constructed out of solid brass, the unexpected modern cube shape is an excellent way to add a chicness to any cabinet door; and since it is made by Emtek, you can be sure that it will last for many years to come. The Square Allerton Cabinet Knob is available in small and large size. Choose from your favorite modern finsih color option.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Allerton Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86700-specifications.pdf?v=1704262430\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Allerton Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86700: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86701: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-518\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
